Spec: Portable Java public contracts

Platform: Java17

Purpose:
  Expose strict public declaration and control contracts usable by Android without changing legacy pairing semantics.

Structure:
  ./src: Portable contract models, validation and conformance checks.

Owns:
  ./src/main/java/dev/linkgate/contracts/ApplicationManifest.java
  ./src/main/java/dev/linkgate/contracts/ConnectionPolicy.java
  ./src/main/java/dev/linkgate/contracts/ContractException.java

References:
  /docs/adr/0001-public-contract-normalization.md
  /contracts/vectors/cases.json
  ./src/main/java/dev/linkgate/contracts/StrictJson.sdd
  ./src/main/java/dev/linkgate/contracts/WireJson.sdd
  ./src/main/java/dev/linkgate/contracts/SecureReply.sdd
  ./src/main/java/dev/linkgate/contracts/ManifestContract.sdd
  ./src/main/java/dev/linkgate/contracts/ControlHello.sdd
  ./src/main/java/dev/linkgate/contracts/ControlReply.sdd
  ./src/main/java/dev/linkgate/contracts/RegistrationReply.sdd
  ./src/main/java/dev/linkgate/contracts/ControlRequest.sdd
  ./src/main/java/dev/linkgate/contracts/PendingRegistry.sdd
  ./src/main/java/dev/linkgate/contracts/ControlRegistration.sdd
  ./src/test/java/dev/linkgate/contracts/ConformanceMain.sdd

Must:
  Validate UTF-8, JSON syntax and schema semantics consistently with the shared corpus.
  Preserve lexical integers and Unicode scalar boundaries rather than coercing values.

Exposes:
  @dev.linkgate.contracts.ManifestContract.parse
  @dev.linkgate.contracts.ManifestContract.normalizePolicy

Tasks:
  [x] #1 Implement the public parser, immutable models and shared-corpus runner.

Done when:
  The corpus runner verifies all selected valid and invalid cases and exits nonzero on any discrepancy.
